From 26e2e16249354ef9f9fc8f255a3f55bf75acadc6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: jevin <jevin@quickjack.ca>
Date: Wed, 19 Aug 2026 08:57:38 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] feat: native master_center layout with configurable
 center_ratio

A fourth layout: quarter | centred master | quarter. The bsp tree is kept
as an ordered container only; view_update assigns every occupied leaf its
frame directly in one pass. Window counts 1 and 2 leave the unused side
columns empty. Slot widths come from 'config center_ratio' (default 0.5);
side columns split the remainder equally and subdivide vertically.

warp/swap/insert/zoom-fullscreen allowed; ratio/zoom-parent/rotate/
mirror/balance/equalize remain bsp-only (internal node areas are not
maintained under this layout).
